<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CarrAmerica upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CarrAmerica upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber said it upgraded CarrAmerica Realty Corp to attractive from neutral.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 3/8 at 28-5/8.</p>
</text>
